<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#humor> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The emotion expressed is lighthearted humor derived from the visual pun and wordplay. The meme juxtaposes the literal mating behavior of goats with the idiomatic phrase 'get the goat,' creating absurdity and comedic effect. The humor is innocent and relies on misunderstanding rather than malice."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#backgroundPreserving> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> _:na36c737a1ca84d419f612ab2c9f0cbd9b4 .
