<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#situationallyIronicalTo> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#Color-matchedIntegration> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Color-matched Integration"@en .
