<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#rhythmicallyIntegratedWith> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subPropertyOf> <http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#compositionallyIntegratedWith> .
<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#mapping_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The top text 'im long and strong' is an analogical mapping that projects the textual description of a person's physical attributes (long and strong) onto the visual entity 'goat_1', which is the male goat in the mating position. The humor arises from the visual pun, where the goat's physical form is being described as if it were a human with those characteristics, aligning with the meme's overall intent to create absurdity through wordplay and visual juxtaposition."@en .
<http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#CausalRelation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class> .
