<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#goat_mating_scene> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A scene depicting two goats engaged in mating behavior on a rocky terrain. The top goat is mounted on the bottom goat, creating a visual pun related to the text overlay. The scene is set outdoors on a sunny day with a clear blue sky and rocky landscape."@en .
