<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#visual_pun_meme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "This meme is a type of internet meme that uses a visual image combined with text to create humor through wordplay or visual irony. The humor arises from the literal interpretation of the idiom 'get the goat' in the context of the image. This requires knowledge of meme culture and visual puns to understand the comedic intent."@en .
