<http://w3c.org/memes-ontology/general/01439#semiotic_projection_1> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The user is projected onto the visual entity 'goat_1' (the male goat in the mating position) through the textual description 'im long and strong'. The text uses first-person pronouns ('im', a colloquial form of 'I') to create a direct identification with the goat, implying the user sees themselves as the 'long and strong' goat. This projection is onto the visual material, specifically the goat's physical form, which is being anthropomorphized with human-like qualities."@en .
